Package: com.music27.tweak
Name: Music27
Version: 1.1.39
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Restyle Apple Music on iOS 16/17 toward the iOS 26/27 Liquid Glass look. 1.1.39: tapping the mini pill no longer plays or pauses — there is no button on the mini player that opens the player, so it now does nothing instead of firing the wrong one, and records what is actually there. The album download button mirrors Music’s own control by rendering it, including the stop ring mid-download.
Maintainer: Music27
Author: Music27
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
